    <briefdescription>
<para>Equity/FX volatility (smile) surface. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This abstract class defines the interface of concrete Equity/FX volatility (smile) surfaces which will be derived from this one.</para><para>Volatilities are assumed to be expressed on an annual basis.</para><para>It&apos;s only in absence of smile that the concept of (at-the-money) forward volatility makes sense. </para>    </detaileddescription>
